      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I bet you're one of the avatar designers. Of course you want know as designer who use your avatar. You're excited to see stats.\nFor other users, it's not important at all.\nThis is more designer request to see own stats. Also visiting your worlds, but it can also used as ranking (thumbs up / down) so that makes also sense...\nAnd there is also how \"long\" avatar will used, so amount of copies will not make clear how long it's used. Unless it's marked as favorite.\nIf avatar is just used for 5 minutes and then never, it has no use as stats. It means someone tried it and don't like it much.",
